:staged-clause-id-ska-dab-bab-ii-pasal-6 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "SKA dan/ atau DAB yang diserahkan sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 3 ayat (1), dapat diberikan Tarif Preferensi jika: a. memenuhi ketentuan prosedural sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 3 dan Pasal 4; dan b. memenuhi Ketentuan Asal Barang yang meliputi: 1. kriteria asal barang (origin criteria); 2. kr" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-id-ska-dab ;
    :clauseLocator "BAB II, Pasal 6" .

:staged-clause-id-ska-dab-pasal-2 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "(1) Ketentuan prosedural dalam rangka penyerahan SKA dan/ atau DAB meliputi: a. prosedur penyerahan SKA dan/atau DAB; b. tanda tangan pejabat yang berwenang dan/ atau stempel resmi dari lnstansi Penerbit SKA; c. tanda tangan eksportir/produsen; dan d. Overleaf Notes. (2) Pelaksanaan ketentuan prosed" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-id-ska-dab ;
    :clauseLocator "Pasal 2" .

:staged-clause-id-ska-dab-pasal-3 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "(1) Importir, Penyelenggara/ Pengusaha TPB, Penyelenggara/ Pengusaha PLB, Pengusaha di Kawasan Bebas, atau Badan Usaha/Pelaku Usaha KEK wajib menyerahkan SKA dan/ atau DAB ke Kantor Pabean. jdih.kemenkeu.go.id (2) Penyerahan SKA dan/ atau DAB sebagaimana dimaksud pada ayat (1), dilakukan dengan meka" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-id-ska-dab ;
    :clauseLocator "Pasal 3" .

:staged-clause-id-ska-dab-pasal-4 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "(1) SKA dan/atau DAB yang diserahkan melalui mekanisme sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 3 ayat (2), merupakan: a. lembar asli SKA atau hasil pindaian berwarna lembar asli SKA; b. hasil unduhan SKA, dalam hal SKA merupakan hasil unduhan dari website Instansi Penerbit SKA; dan/atau c. lembar asli DAB " ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-id-ska-dab ;
    :clauseLocator "Pasal 4" .

:staged-clause-id-ska-dab-pasal-5 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "(1) Dalam hal SKA dan/atau DAB yang diserahkan melalui mekanisrrte sebagaimana dimaksud dalam Pasal 3 ayat (2) huruf b belum dapat diyakini kebenaran dan keakuratannya, Pejabat Bea dan Cukai dapat meminta lmportir, Penyelenggara/Pengusaha TPB, Penyelenggara/ Pengusaha PLB, Pengusaha di Kawasan Bebas" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-id-ska-dab ;
    :clauseLocator "Pasal 5" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-1-register-for-a-unique-entity-number a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "You must first register with the Accounting and Corporate Regulatory Authority (ACRA) (opens in new tab) or the relevant Unique Entity Number (UEN) issuance agency (opens in new tab) to obtain a UEN." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "1. Register for a Unique Entity Number" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-2-activate-your-customs-account a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "After receiving your UEN, activate your Customs Account with Singapore Customs. This is required before any import permit application can be submitted." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "2. Activate Your Customs Account" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-after-you-apply a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Once your permit is approved, follow the conditions stated on the permit for cargo clearance and payment of duties and GST (where applicable). Ready to apply? Submit your application through TradeNet using your preferred front-end channel. Submit via TradeNet (opens in new tab)" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "After You Apply" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-how-to-submit-permit-applications a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "All import permit applications must be submitted through TradeNet, using one of the following channels: TradeNet front-end software from an approved software vendor ; or Government Front-End Application (opens in new tab) These channels allow you or your DA to process import declarations and receive" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "How to Submit Permit Applications" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-how-you-can-apply-for-import-permits a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Once your Customs Account is activated, you may choose one of the following options:" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "How You Can Apply for Import Permits" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-obtain-a-customs-import-permit a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Learn how to obtain a Customs Import Permit by registering for a Unique Entity Number, activating your Customs account, and applying through TradeNet." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "Obtain a Customs Import Permit" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-option-a-appoint-a-declaring-agent a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "A Declaring Agent (DA) can apply for customs permits on your behalf." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "Option A: Appoint a Declaring Agent" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-option-b-apply-for-permits-yourself a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "If you prefer to make declarations yourself or for your clients, you must: Register as a DA, and Apply for a TradeNet User ID (opens in new tab) to access the system." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "Option B: Apply for Permits Yourself" .

:staged-clause-sg-customs-permit-ready-to-apply a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Submit your application through TradeNet using your preferred front-end channel." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-customs-permit ;
    :clauseLocator "Ready to apply?" .

