:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-db4a9f94 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "SFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensures food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses. As meat has a higher risk of being contaminated with pathogens compared to processed food or vegetables, SFA" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Meat and Meat Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-how-do-these-import-requirements-ensure-e79bf05f a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "SFA adopts a science and risk-based approach to ensure that food is safe for consumption in Singapore. The requirements imposed ensure food safety and reduce the risk of foodborne illnesses. There is a risk of bacteria, known as Salmonella Enteritidis, in fresh eggs. To address the risks, SFA requir" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "How do these import requirements ensure the food safety of Eggs & Egg Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-meat-and-meat-products a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Contents in this page" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "Meat and Meat Products" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-what-food-or-food-products-must-meet-th-4110deca a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Food or food products classified as ‘Fish & Fish Products’, including types of seafood (e.g. live fish, canned tuna, crabs, prawns, sea cucumbers, and squids) must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products. To check if your food or food product falls under ‘Fish " ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Fish & Fish Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-what-food-or-food-products-must-meet-th-906cb886 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Food or food products classified as ‘Eggs & Egg Products’ such as shell eggs, salted eggs, liquid eggs, and omelettes must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products. To check if your food or food product falls under ‘Eggs & Egg Products’, use the Food and Related" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Eggs & Egg Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-what-food-or-food-products-must-meet-th-f96dc4c1 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "Imports classified as ‘Meat & Meat Products’ must meet the import requirements imposed on this category of food or food products. Examples of ‘Meat & Meat Products’ include, but are not limited to, fresh poultry and meats, pizza with meat toppings and barbequed meats (bak kwa). To check if your food" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "What food or food products must meet the import requirements for Meat & Meat Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-when-should-i-comply-with-these-require-00098bfe a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "You must comply with these requirements before you apply for an import permit to bring Eggs & Egg Products into Singapore. Non-compliance can result in penalties under the prevailing food safety laws and regulations ." ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "When should I comply with these requirements for Eggs & Egg Products?" .

:staged-clause-sg-sfa-processed-where-can-i-find-the-import-requirement-17ca889e a owl:NamedIndividual,
        :SourceClause ;
    rdfs:comment "The import requirements can be found in the Wholesome Meat and Fish (Import, Export and Transhipment) Rules . You must comply with the import requirements before you apply for an import permit to bring Meat & Meat Products into Singapore. Non-compliance can result in penalties under the prevailing f" ;
    :clauseInDocument :source-sg-sfa-processed ;
    :clauseLocator "Where can I find the import requirements for Meat & Meat Products?" .

